# ===================================================
# KHUSUS MODUL PENDAFTARAN EVENT SISWA (TERPISAH)
# ===================================================

### 1. Lihat Seluruh Data Pendaftar Event (Daftar Rekap Pendaftaran)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/pendaftaran-event
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Simpan Pendaftaran Siswa Baru (Form Pendaftaran Event)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/pendaftaran-event
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "event_id": 1,
    "nama_siswa": "Manis.",
    "nisn": "234567890",
    "kelas": "XI RPL 2",
    "catatan": "Ingin menambah pengalaman dalam event sekolah"
}

###

### 3. Pendaftaran Siswa via Endpoint Alternative (Kompatibilitas Form Frontend)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/events/1/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "nama_siswa": "Naura Lutfiah",
    "nisn": "123456789",
    "kelas": "XI RPL 1",
    "catatan": "Berpartisipasi aktif dalam kegiatan OSIS"
}

###

### 4. Lihat Daftar Peserta Terdaftar Khusus untuk Event Tertentu (Pop-up Modal Peserta)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/events/1/peserta
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Hapus / Batalkan Data Pendaftar Event Berdasarkan ID
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/pendaftaran-event/1
Accept: application/json
